{% doc %}
  @param {object} contract - test contract object tracking results
{% enddoc %}
{% comment %}
  These are contract/shape smoke tests, not path-correctness tests - they
  assert graceful failure in the absence of live Accela credentials (the
  expected state for automated test runs); with real credentials
  configured some assertions here would need to expect success instead.
{% endcomment %}
{% liquid
